    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Sculptural Ivory Candles | KASODI</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Discover Sculptural Ivory Candles by ALMA DE LLAMA, a set of two decorative candles made in Spain from natural rapeseed wax and selected by KASODI for their flowing sculptural form."
    />
  </head>

  <body>

    <Header />


    <main class="product-detail-page">

      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <a href="/kasodi-edit">KASODI Edit</a>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>SCULPTURAL IVORY CANDLES</span>
      </div>


      <section class="product-detail-hero">

        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img
            src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-sculptural-ivory-candles.png"
            alt="Sculptural Ivory Candles by ALMA DE LLAMA"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="product-detail-content">

          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
            KASODI EDIT · CANDLES & FRAGRANCE
          </p>

          <h1>
            Sculptural Ivory Candles
          </h1>

          <p class="product-detail-brand">
            ALMA DE LLAMA
          </p>

          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A set of two sculptural candles crafted from natural rapeseed wax,
            defined by flowing, wave-like lines and a soft ivory finish.
            Their organic silhouette gives them the presence of small decorative
            objects, bringing texture and quiet character to shelves, tables and
            intimate corners of the home.
          </p>


          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>


          <div class="product-detail-meta">

            <div>
              <span>Material</span>
              <strong>Rapeseed vegetable wax</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Set</span>
              <strong>2 candles</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Dimensions</span>
              <strong>8 × 12 cm each</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Colour</span>
              <strong>Ivory</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Scent</span>
              <strong>Unscented</strong>
            </div>

            <div>
              <span>Made in</span>
              <strong>Spain</strong>
            </div>

          </div>


          <div class="affiliate-action">

            <a
              href="https://amzn.to/469clJF"
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow sponsored"
              class="product-shop-button"
            >
              Find It Here →
            </a>

            <p class="affiliate-note">
              Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="why-we-love">

        <div class="why-we-love-label">
          KASODI NOTE
        </div>

        <div class="why-we-love-content">

          <h2>Why we love it</h2>

          <p>
            These sculptural candles blur the line between functional candle
            and decorative object. Their softly folded, wave-like form catches
            the light beautifully and adds movement to an otherwise simple
            arrangement.
          </p>

          <p>
            Made in Spain from natural rapeseed wax, the pair works especially
            well in warm, minimal interiors where shape and texture do the
            decorating. Because they are unscented, they are also easy to use
            around dining areas without competing with food or fragrance.
          </p>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-care">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          CARE
        </p>

        <h2>Burn beautifully & safely</h2>

        <p>
          Trim the wick to approximately 6 mm before lighting. Keep the candle
          away from drafts, vibrations and flammable objects, and place it on
          a level, heat-resistant surface. Never leave a burning candle
          unattended and do not burn for more than four hours at a time.
        </p>

      </section>


      <section class="styling-ideas">

        <div class="styling-heading">
          <p>KASODI STYLING</p>
          <h2>Style it with</h2>
        </div>


        <div class="styling-grid">

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Travertine & Stone</h3>
            <p>
              Place them on pale stone, travertine or a simple ceramic tray
              to emphasise their sculptural silhouette.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Warm Wood</h3>
            <p>
              Oak and walnut add natural warmth and create a beautiful contrast
              with the soft ivory wax.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="styling-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Collected Objects</h3>
            <p>
              Style them beside books, ceramics or a small vase to create an
              understated layered arrangement.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="continue-exploring">

        <div class="continue-exploring-heading">
          <p>KASODI EDIT</p>
          <h2>Continue Exploring</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/boston-green-wine-glass"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-villeroy-boch-boston-green-glass.png"
                alt="Boston Green Wine Glass by Villeroy & Boch"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>GLASSWARE</span>
              <h3>Boston Green Wine Glass</h3>
              <p>Villeroy & Boch</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a
            href="/kasodi-edit/botanical-vintage-pitcher"
            class="continue-card"
          >

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-floral-ceramic-pitcher.png"
                alt="Botanical Vintage Pitcher by Ethereal Eves"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>HOME DECOR</span>
              <h3>Botanical Vintage Pitcher</h3>
              <p>Ethereal Eves</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


          <a href="/kasodi-edit/embroidered-garden-cushions" class="continue-card">

            <div class="continue-card-image">
              <img
                src="/images/kasodi-edit/kasodi-edit-embroidered-green-cushions.png"
                alt="Embroidered Garden Cushions by Running Elephant"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="continue-card-info">
              <span>TEXTILES & COZY</span>
              <h3>Embroidered Garden Cushions</h3>
              <p>Running Elephant</p>
              <strong>Discover →</strong>
            </div>

          </a>


        </div>

      </section>


      <section class="product-final-cta">

        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">
          ALMA DE LLAMA · SCULPTURAL CANDLES
        </p>

        <h2>
          Sculptural light for the quiet corners of home.
        </h2>

        <a
          href="https://amzn.to/469clJF"
          target="_blank"
          rel="nofollow sponsored"
          class="product-shop-button"
        >
          Find It Here →
        </a>

        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">
          Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.
        </p>

      </section>

    </main>


    <Footer />

  </body>
</html>